  title: 'Arguing the Other Side',
  grade: 'Class 8',
  emoji: '🗣️',
  chapterText:
      'For the inter-school debate competition, Kabir had prepared for weeks to argue against the motion '
      '"Social media does more harm than good," confident in his ability to list every benefit of online '
      'platforms convincingly. Two days before the event, however, the organisers announced that teams would '
